+ * A request relayed towards our own PLMN must name one of our NFs,
+ * i.e. <...>.mncXXX.mccXXX.3gppnetwork.org with a serving PLMN-ID.
+ * Anything else (IP literal, non-3GPP host) is not a valid N32 target.
